	(property "Description" "Micro-Fit 3.0 vertical through-hole. Exact Molex header and matching 43025 housing. Motor contacts use 18 AWG; signal contacts use 24 AWG. Apply manufacturer populated-circuit/temperature derating; not the single-contact maximum. Pin10 has no harness terminal. Separate J11 supplies the Cytron. Neither motor-output pair is GND."
